          "snippet": {
            "line": 65,
            "text": "theorem StripData.separate_powers_le_growth (s : StripData D) (p q n : ℕ) (x : D) :\n    s.slow n ^ p * (max 1 (s.delta x)⁻¹) ^ q ≤ s.growth n x ^ (p + q)"
